
### Create customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Martin"
}

### Get customer by ID (replace with the ID returned by Create customer)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### List all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### List active customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers?status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json

### Change customer status (replace with the ID returned by Create customer)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}
